        data-toggle="tooltip" 
        data-placement="left" href="/uploads/files/FAQ_s-Cashless-system-on-reserves-Public-Visitors.pdf" 
        target="_blank"><i class="fas fa-link"></i><span class="sr-only">FAQs Cashless System On Reserves - Public Visitors</span></a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light text-secondary" title="Download FAQs Cashless System On Reserves - Public Visitors" 
        data-toggle="tooltip" 
        data-placement="left" href="/uploads/files/FAQ_s-Cashless-system-on-reserves-Public-Visitors.pdf" 
        download target="_blank"><i class="fas fa-download"></i><span class="sr-only">FAQs Cashless System On Reserves - Public Visitors</span></a></div></div><!-- end:_components/molecules/file--><!--_components/molecules/file--><div class="list-group-item d-flex align-items-start  mb-3 shadow-sm"><div class="icon mr-3"><i class="fal fa-2x fa-file"></i></div><div class="h6 mr-auto my-0 font-family-base"><a title='View in browser' class="text-decoration-none text-primary" href="/uploads/files/Reserves/CapeNature-Jonkershoek-2025.pdf" target="_blank">Cape Nature Jonkershoek 2025</a><div class="text-muted small mt-1">1.354 MB</div></div><div class="d-flex text-nowrap"><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light text-secondary mr-2" title='View in browser' 
        data-toggle="tooltip" 
        data-placement="left" href="/uploads/files/Reserves/CapeNature-Jonkershoek-2025.pdf" 
        target="_blank"><i class="fas fa-link"></i><span class="sr-only">Cape Nature Jonkershoek 2025</span></a><a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-light text-secondary" title="Download Cape Nature Jonkershoek 2025" 
        data-toggle="tooltip" 
        data-placement="left" href="/uploads/files/Reserves/CapeNature-Jonkershoek-2025.pdf" 
        download target="_blank"><i class="fas fa-download"></i><span class="sr-only">Cape Nature Jonkershoek 2025</span></a></div></div><!-- end:_components/molecules/file--></div><!-- end:_components/molecules/download--></div><div data-type="heading" 
  class=" text-left"><div class="d-flex border border-primary border-top-0 border-left-0 border-right-0 mb-4"><!--_components/atoms/heading--><h2 class="mb-lastchild-0 mb-3 text-primary">How to get there</h2><!-- end:_components/atoms/heading--></div></div><div data-type="text" 
  class="mb-4"><!--_components/atoms/text--><span class="mb-lastchild-0"><p>From Cape Town: Take the N2 highway out of Cape Town towards Stellenbosch. Take exit 33 for Baden Powell Drive towards the R310/Stellenbosch/Macassar. Turn right onto Polkadraai Road/R310 and follow the road. It becomes Adam Tas Street. Turn right onto Langstraat-Suid Road and continue onto Helshoogte Road. Turn right onto Simonsberg Road and at the roundabout take the first exit onto Martinson Road. Continue onto Jonkershoek Road and follow the signs until your reach the reserve entrance.</p><p>GPS: 33 57 48.70 S  18 55 31.98 E</p><p><strong>Opening times:</strong></p><p><strong>Winter: (1 May – 31 August) Includes May, Jun, Jul, Aug</strong>:<br>08:00 – 16:00.<br><strong>Summer: (1 September - 30 April) Includes Sept, Oct, Nov, Dec, Jan, Feb, Mar, Apr</strong>: <br>07:00 – 16:00 <br><strong>Gates Close:</strong><br>18:00 (everyone is expected to have exited by then).</p><p><strong>Hiking trails have daily cut-off times to ensure that clients can access, safely hike and exit on time.</strong></p><ul><li>Waterval 1 and 2: No access after 14:00 </li><li>Swartboskloof and Panorama: No access after 10:00</li><li>Sosyskloof: No access after 12:00</li><li>Exit: 18:00</li></ul><p>Office number: 087 087 4118<br></p><p>Permits can be pre-purchased for the Jonkershoek hiking trails via the&nbsp;<strong><a href="https://www.mtotrails.com/cape-nature-trails" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-auth="NotApplicable" data-linkindex="0">MTO website</a>&nbsp;</strong>or at the MTO gate on the day.&nbsp;</p><p>CapeNature accepts Wild Cards; however, clients must present either a confirmation letter or the physical Wild Card to gain access to the hiking trails.<br></p></span><!-- end:_components/atoms/text--></div><div data-type="video" 
  class="mb-4 "><!--_components/molecules/video-embedded--><div class="position-relative"><!--_components/molecules/image--><!--_components/atoms/img-lazy--><img class="lazyload img-fluid w-100" src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27920%27%20height%3D%27613%27%20style%3D%27background%3A%23F1F3F4%27%2F%3E" alt="Image related to website content" title="Image related to website content" data-sizes="auto" data-srcset="https://www.capenature.co.za/uploads/imager/uploads/files/jonkershoek-overlay-video_W920_H613_Mcrop_upscale1_autoformat-compress_CZ1_I1.png 920w" /><!-- end:_components/atoms/img-lazy--><!-- end:_components/molecules/image--><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0VdtWe3jCTs" 
    class="card-img-overlay d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-decoration-none text-white gradient-full" 
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    data-mfp-type="iframe"><i class="fal fa-play-circle fa-4x alpha-75"></i><span class="sr-only">Jonkershoek Nature Reserve</span></a></div><!-- end:_components/molecules/video-embedded--></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-3"><!--_components/molecules/booking-card--><div class="shadow-sm border p-1 "><div class="bg-primary text-secondary d-flex p-3 px-2 justify-content-center align-items-center"><span class="mr-auto text-uppercase  font-weight-bold h6 mb-0">Tariffs</span><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i></div><div class="p-3 px-2 text-primary d-flex flex-column"><p>Explore the great outdoors with our affordable hiking packages starting from just R55 per day.</p></div></div><a href="https://www.capenature.co.za/jonkershoek-nature-reserve-tariffs" class="external-link d-block bg-secondary text-primary text-center p-3 hover-bg-primary shadow-sm rounded-bottom mb-4 ">
  See Tariffs
</a><!-- end:_components/molecules/booking-card--><!--_components/molecules/booking-card--><div class="shadow-sm border p-1 mb-4"><div class="bg-primary text-secondary d-flex p-3 px-2 justify-content-center align-items-center"><span class="mr-auto text-uppercase  font-weight-bold h6 mb-0">Conservation Fees</span><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i></div><div class="p-3 px-2 text-primary d-flex flex-column"><p class='font-weight-bold mb-0'>Adults</p><p>Day Access = R80</p><p class='font-weight-bold mb-0'>Children (ages 4 to 17)</p><p>Day Access = R55</p></div></div><!-- end:_components/molecules/booking-card--><!--_components/molecules/plan-your-trip-menu--><div class="shadow-sm mb-4"><div class="card rounded-0  border"><a href="/conservations/jonkershoek-nature-reserve-conservation" class="text-decoration-none"><div class="p-2 card-body mb-lastchild-0 text-primary text-center border-bottom border-1 border-bottom ">Jonkershoek Nature Reserve Conservation</div></a><a href="/filming-and-photography-information" class="text-decoration-none"><div class="p-2 card-body mb-lastchild-0 text-primary text-center border-bottom border-1 border-bottom ">Filming and photography information</div></a><a href="/permits" class="text-decoration-none"><div class="p-2 card-body mb-lastchild-0 text-primary text-center border-bottom border-1 border-bottom ">All you need to know about permits</div></a><a href="/landscape-central" class="text-decoration-none"><div class="p-2 card-body mb-lastchild-0 text-primary text-center border-bottom border-1 border-bottom ">Landscape Central</div></a><a href="/fire-prevention" class="text-decoration-none"><div class="p-2 card-body mb-lastchild-0 text-primary text-center border-bottom border-1 ">Fire prevention</div></a></div></div><!-- end:_components/molecules/plan-your-trip-menu--><div class="mb-4"><a href="/world-heritage-sites"><!--_components/molecules/image--><!--_components/atoms/img-lazy--><img src="data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%27http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%27%20width%3D%27500%27%20height%3D%27500%27%20style%3D%27background%3A%23F1F3F4%27%2F%3E" alt="Image related to website content" title="Image related to website content" class="lazyload w-100 shadow-sm rounded" data-sizes="auto" data-srcset="https://www.capenature.co.za/uploads/imager/uploads/files/Promo-Bannerads/WorldHeritage_Banner_W500_Mcrop_upscale1_autoformat-compress_CZ1_I1_ratio.png 500w" /><!-- end:_components/atoms/img-lazy--><!-- end:_components/molecules/image--></a></div><!--_components/molecules/booking-card--><div class="shadow-sm border p-1 "><div class="bg-primary text-secondary d-flex p-3 px-2 justify-content-center align-items-center"><span class="mr-auto text-uppercase  font-weight-bold h6 mb-0">Filming</span><i class="fa fa-info-circle"></i></div><div class="p-3 px-2 text-primary d-flex flex-column"><h5>Jonkershoek Nature Reserve Filming</h5><p>There are various filming options in the Jonkershoek Nature Reserve, including:</p><ul><li> 10 km circular gravel road to the valley</li><li>Assegaaibosch River</li><li>Picnic Area</li></ul></div></div><a href="/film-locations/jonkershoek-nature-reserve-filming" class="external-link d-block bg-secondary text-primary text-center p-3 hover-bg-primary shadow-sm rounded-bottom mb-4 ">
  Find out more
</a><!-- end:_components/molecules/booking-card--><div class="mb-4"><!--_components/atoms/heading--><h5 class="mb-lastchild-0 mb-3 text-primary text-uppercase">Visitors Gallery</h5><!-- end:_components/atoms/heading--><!--_components/molecules/gallery--><div class="d-flex flex-wrap" data-mfp-type="gallery"><div class="col-sm-4 p-0"><div  class="media-column-overlay-hover-ply" data-mfp-src="https://www.capenature.co.za/uploads/imager/uploads/files/Jonkershoek-with-WHS-logo-1_W800.jpg" data-description=""><a href="https://www.capenature.co.za/uploads/imager/uploads/files/Jonkershoek-with-WHS-logo-1_W800.jpg" 
